- **Reuse, do not re-implement:** `ParseSampleShards` (sample split), `PgenRowGenotypes`/`GenotypeCalls`
  /`PgenAppendCallRange` (slice), `CheckSampleShardResources` (guard, on N), `WritePsamFromIids`,
