  stale-catalog handling.
- **New test file** `test/sql/write_pfile_matrix.test`. Do NOT edit the P13-007 / sharded test files.
- **No regression:** plain bundle, variant `shard_by`, and `shard_samples` paths stay green. Full
  suite (`./build/release/test/unittest '[sql]'`) green.
